{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>近日11月社交平台Threads突然被一股GU試身熱潮全面洗版，一件特價舊款保暖衣竟然衝破25萬瀏覽量。大批女 …</p><p></p>\n<p>近日11月社交平台Threads突然被一股GU試身熱潮全面洗版，一件特價舊款保暖衣竟然衝破25萬瀏覽量。大批女生湧入各大分店試身室瘋狂打卡，將原本平平無奇基本款穿出強烈視覺衝擊。這場被戲稱為性感穿搭大賽網絡風暴，背後隱藏著讓無數男網民暴動並揚言要帶老婆掃貨驚人流量密碼。</p>\n<h2>Threads掀起GU保暖衣試身室打卡熱潮</h2>\n<p>這股突如其來的搶購旋風源於Threads上一篇試穿帖文，有女網民實穿GU常駐基本款保暖透膚高領T恤後大讚剪裁並分享自拍。帖文迅速獲得過萬讚好，隨即引發全網女生跟風，各大門市試身室瞬間成為各路日系辣妹與氣質女孩爭奇鬥艷舞台。網上充斥著灰、白、黑等各色實穿照片，眾人紛紛展現個人專屬風格解析，將一件原本用作打底禦寒衣物轉化為極具話題度社交貨幣。</p>\n<h2>女網民大方分享GU保暖衣試穿及挑選尺碼心得</h2>\n<p>隨著試身自拍接力賽持續延燒，這款上衣迅速成為當下最熱門流量關鍵字，女生們除了比拼穿搭技巧，更熱烈交流挑選尺碼實戰心得。最初發文女網民在帖文中驚呼「跟住Threads買衫真係冇錯」，並特別提到「係咪我攞太細件，真係好透」。這番真實評價引來不少同好留言提醒買細碼會大幅增加透膚度，大家互相分享如何利用不同尺碼營造出由微辣到性感各種視覺效果，徹底顛覆大眾對傳統保暖內衣刻板印象。</p>\n<h2>特價舊款保暖衣隱藏設計巧思意外造就神級單品</h2>\n<p>這款被網民封為最新一代神衣單品並非今年度全新設計，而是品牌長期發售舊款特價貨品。衣服主打輕薄質地與貼身羅紋設計，能夠完美修飾腰線比例並勾勒出纖幼小蠻腰，微透膚布料更會在若隱若現間展現豐滿上圍。這種兼顧保暖與純欲風大膽視覺衝突感，加上極度親民平價定位，在社交平台演算法推波助瀾下成功創造出驚人爆發力，讓一件過季舊款迎來意想不到搶購熱潮。</p>\n<h2>破格透膚視覺效果惹來大批男網民暴動揚言掃貨</h2>\n<p>試身室一連串震撼視覺畫面不僅讓女生陷入瘋狂，更成功吸引大批男網民高度關注並瘋狂轉發。不少男性看到貼身剪裁帶來驚艷效果後大呼停不下來，紛紛留言驚嘆「一件GU保暖衣，炸出一堆身材咁好嘅女仔！」，直指「呢波流量密碼太狠」。熱烈討論更釣出許多已婚男士幽默表態，高呼「呢個Weekend就帶老婆去GU報到！」，大量男女網民踴躍參與成功讓部分門市熱門色號與尺碼陷入斷貨狀態。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17955988618469618_6098905116b06aa0e4ad61.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-25 at 17.21.52 (1).jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17955988618469618_6098905116b06aa0e4ad61.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559886342417053_3183328796b06aa0fd8980.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-25 at 17.19.48.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559886342417053_3183328796b06aa0fd8980.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559886434979930_7720290336b06aa10e5aec.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-25 at 17.19.39.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559886434979930_7720290336b06aa10e5aec.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559886564426654_19840165176b06aa1230716.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6069124205178983746.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559886564426654_19840165176b06aa1230716.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559886710777976_18080356766b06aa137b958.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6069124205178983747.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559886710777976_18080356766b06aa137b958.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559886790211597_5411990716b06aa14563e9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6069124205178983745.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179559886790211597_5411990716b06aa14563e9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/gu%e4%bf%9d%e6%9a%96%e8%a1%a3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GU保暖衣</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/threads%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Threads熱話</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%a9%bf%e6%90%ad%e6%bd%ae%e6%b5%81/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">穿搭潮流</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3550018\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 25 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:43:56.570028+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1399,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T09:27:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T11:48:16.208376+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T10:37:21.912059+00:00","content_hash":"0b11ac83133553677333c3e1422dbb6c1219d4b07ad41ca3764b98fceb351938","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}